WEBVTT

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:33.030
I'm glad you made it here.

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:34.320
I've been waiting for you.

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:38.530
When I heard that voice, I suddenly felt,

00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:43.080
"This guy likes to hurt people."

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.950
I was sure of it.

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:47.290
Hm?

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:49.080
You're unexpectedly brave.

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.960
Even though you don't
understand anything yet,

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.840
you seem to have mastered
the use of your left eye.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.090
I can understand why the Princess has been watching you.

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:58.840
Who are you anyway?

00:01:58.840 --> 00:02:00.140
Look, I have things to do today,

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:02.600
so I'd appreciate it if you'd send me
back where I came from.

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.270
My, such impudence.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:07.100
I have nothing against strong-willed types,

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:10.610
but I do dislike arrogant, worthless humans...

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:14.440
and I hate the stupid ones even more.

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:21.570
Tell me, do you know which is superior,
a human or a robot?

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:26.450
The answer is obviously the human brain.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:32.840
The neurons in the brain have greater information processing power than a computer.

00:02:34.300 --> 00:02:40.300
Meaning that humans who cannot use their brains are worth no more than a chunk of metal.

00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:43.300
So I wonder about you.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.350
You! You're from the other world, aren't you?!

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.690
What an inelegant way of putting it.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:53.270
This is a place where impossible
events can happen.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:56.320
Taking that into consideration,
it's called "Amatsuki,"

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:58.690
meaning "a rainy night's moon."

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:05.330
The Princess seems to call your world "Higan,"
meaning "the other shore."

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:08.160
Amatsuki and Higan.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:13.170
And so, you will be shown two paths.

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:20.970
Will you destroy Amatsuki and the Princess, so you can return to Higan,

00:03:22.180 --> 00:03:27.220
or will you call on me to protect Amatsuki and thereby become its master?

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:30.060
Destroy the Princess?

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:32.150
Who the hell <i>are</i> you?!

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.480
What are you hiding?!

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.230
I discarded my real name a long time ago.

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:38.940
However, I will tell you what I go by now.

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.490
My name is

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:49.200
"Bon," meaning "awakened one," and "Ten," meaning "enlightened opinions."

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:50.870
Bonten.

00:03:50.870 --> 00:03:53.710
Once you've made up your mind, that's what you should call me.

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:57.210
That's the only thing you're useful for.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.380
When you call that name,

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:05.890
I will serve only you, in the whole world.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.710
You're finally awake, Toki?

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:44.590
Where am I?

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:45.720
Why am I here?

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:48.220
This is a room inside the shrine.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:52.270
She let you rest here for a while,
until you regained consciousness.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:55.440
You certainly surprised us,
disappearing from before our eyes like that.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:01.570
When we searched the area,
we found you collapsed in the shrine grounds.

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:03.280
What on earth happened to you?

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:07.990
Because you were unconscious,
we tried to carry you back,

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.280
but then this girl called us.

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:12.870
She said we could use this room.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:16.370
We couldn't leave you sprawled out on the paving stones all day,

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:17.790
so we accepted her kind offer.

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:20.290
S-So that's what happened.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:25.050
Shinshu's duty is to act as a guide for guests
and help keep the place tidy.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:29.550
Shinshu... Do you live at this shrine?

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:33.720
Yes. You're the ones that the Divine
Princess wanted to meet, aren't you?

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:34.770
The Princess?

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:37.730
Yes, yes, that's us.

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:38.810
Will you take us to her?

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:40.570
Um, well...

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.820
I can't take you to her.

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:47.950
The Princess is dead now.

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:49.030
She's dead?

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:50.580
What do you mean?

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.030
Did something happen to her?

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:54.410
No, it's not like that.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:58.040
The Princess is born anew
each day and dies each day.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:01.040
What does that mean?

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:06.090
What?!

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.590
I missed them.

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:10.180
Who's there?

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:13.810
<i>We</i> should be the ones
asking <i>you</i> that, vile demon!

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:15.890
You did well getting this far.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.650
Fire!

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.570
Wait! You might hit this girl!

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:24.780
My name is Shinshu.

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:27.070
Shinshu-chan, are you all right?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:27.860
Yeah.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:30.780
Kuchiha, can you lower the bamboo blinds hanging from the eaves?

00:06:39.040 --> 00:06:42.340
Shinonome! You shouldn't use
violence against girls.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:43.670
You...

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:45.590
Don't be so cocky!

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:51.550
What?!

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.470
What the—

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.980
May your own shadow bind you, bastard!

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:03.230
Any wound you inflict on it will be reflected on your own body!

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:05.070
And that goes for you as well!

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.450
It's because you're causing so much trouble.

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:14.240
Shinshu, it's you!

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.450
Did you invite them into the shrine?

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:18.540
But these people are—

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:20.330
Shut up! Don't be a fool!

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:24.000
Do you even know what this shrine is?

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:28.960
This is Sakagami Shrine, sacred ground
under the care of the great Divine Princess.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:34.890
You went so far as to deceive Shinshu,
in order to take Her Highness's life.

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:36.220
You demon scum.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:38.220
Hold on a minute!

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:41.060
The Princess herself summoned us here.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:41.940
This is a misunderstanding!

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:45.690
There's a barrier on that road to lead tainted ones astray.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:48.780
When the barrier stopped you,
and you lost your way on that road,

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.200
your identities became quite obvious.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:56.200
It's too late now to beg for your lives.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:57.700
But that—

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.000
So it was a barrier after all.

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:03.170
Relax.

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:05.960
I'm the sole reason that the barrier was activated.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.380
What are you saying?

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:09.590
However much I may want to deny it,

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:12.760
I can't remove the taint from my body.

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:13.970
Taint?

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:16.680
These two are different from me.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.100
They're human.

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:21.560
They won't try anything, so please let them go.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:22.480
I'm begging you.

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.150
Kuchiha!

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:26.610
I'm begging you.

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:28.900
No, you can't!

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.900
You don't have to say something like that.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.700
You don't need to look so sad.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:38.530
After all, Kuchiha, you're so strong and cool, and you're really cute.

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:40.450
You're a normal girl.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.040
Toki.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:45.500
Stop your whining!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.710
There's a quick way to find out
what you really are!

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:57.300
You see. The shadows pass through your bodies and change shape

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:59.640
to show your true monstrous forms.

00:09:09.900 --> 00:09:13.150
Just as I thought, you're a pawn of that tengu.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:14.740
Tengu?

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:19.370
What the hell did he do to my eye?!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.370
Kuchiha!

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.970
This one is a demon hound.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.840
She's a big catch.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.680
Does she serve Yakou?

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:45.680
You think I am ruled by such a fledgling?

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:47.690
What a grave insult.

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:53.860
Well, it does come from a third-rate priestess,
who has little supernatural power.

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:55.650
What the hell?!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:56.860
Scum!

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:01.870
My, my, you want a piece of me?

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:05.000
Since you so kindly invoked my physical form,

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.370
I will grant you a quick death with no suffering.

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.420
Stop your prattling!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:13.380
I'll skin you and make your hide into a rug for the Princess!

00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:31.610
Vermin! Are you trying
to protect this woman?

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:36.940
I mostly don't intend to get in your way,
although that's rich coming from me.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:40.410
You! You didn't feel anything from that?

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.370
Thanks to you.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:45.450
You want to be crushed between my jaws too?

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:50.460
Don't rush me. Be patient.

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:55.000
I can hear it, that damned sniggering laughter!

00:10:55.000 --> 00:10:56.800
Creepy bastard!

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:58.340
Who are you? Show yourself!

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.630
Well, well, my apologies.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.220
I suppose the show is over.

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:08.980
Your Highness! You mustn't come out here!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:11.020
It's all right, Tsuruume.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:14.650
That boy is the one I told
Sasaki to bring to me.

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:18.070
And those two accompanied him, yes?

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:20.650
See! The Princess <i>did</i> summon them.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:24.530
But then, are these people, u-um...

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:25.660
Quite so.

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.790
He is the "Blank Page,"

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:30.540
and he is my guest.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.500
That tengu...

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:35.840
It seems that he has done
the boy some mischief.

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:40.050
He has used the boy's
left eye to spy on us.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:45.890
Tsuruume, cleanse the boy
of the tengu's taint.

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:46.430
At once!

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.520
It's all right.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.940
A little thing like
that can be fixed easily.

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:53.440
No way!

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:54.940
You!

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.980
A pleasure to meet you, my guests.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.280
I am the master of this shrine.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:03.320
I am Shamon's and Sasaki's superior,

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:05.030
a bitter foe to the tengu,

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.950
the natural enemy of demons,

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.410
and the defender of all humanity.

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:13.120
I am Ginshu.

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.090
My humble thanks for making your way here,

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:19.840
Rikugou-dono.

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:22.840
It's—

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:26.350
It's just ventriloquism!

00:12:26.350 --> 00:12:28.320
It's probably not, you know.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.270
I can't hear you!

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:31.850
That's definitely ventriloquism.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.480
Just leave it at that.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:35.600
It's not some haunted Japanese doll!

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:36.860
It's not terrifying!

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:38.570
What's the matter with you?

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.110
Demons don't faze you,
but ghosts are a whole other matter?

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:45.030
But demons are just like weird animals!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.870
You <i>are</i> a funny one.

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.080
But calm yourself.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:54.870
I do not wear this form by choice.

00:12:55.210 --> 00:12:59.880
My role is to defeat demons that perform evil deeds, as the people wish.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:05.840
But a powerful demon on the verge of death can leave behind a curse.

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:09.510
And I am afflicted by such a curse.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:13.390
Without inhabiting a doll like this,
I cannot continue to exist.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:15.390
A curse?!

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:16.400
No!

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.560
Shinshu! Your Highness! Get back!

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:24.400
That is no curse.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.570
That is retribution.

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:31.120
Retribution for the so-called demons that you self-righteously slaughtered.

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:35.410
It's vermin like you who have
persecuted this girl.

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.120
What's the matter?

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:39.920
Aren't you going to do something?

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:43.130
Why don't you explain your so-called justice?!

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:47.380
It's not that she <i>has</i> no answer, it's that she <i>can't</i> answer.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:55.730
I'm sad to say that she has
no power at all on her own.

00:13:57.850 --> 00:13:58.770
Who's that?

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:02.230
She cannot defeat demons
or stand on her own feet.

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.900
She cannot even speak on her own.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:09.530
Ah, how pitiful you are, Princess.

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:12.160
Is your desire to live so strong
that you would endure this much?

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:15.950
Vile tengu! How did you get in here?

00:14:15.950 --> 00:14:16.870
What have you done?!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.920
Oh, I just borrowed this girl's
consciousness for a while.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:23.000
Right now, all I can do is talk to you.

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:26.630
Rest assured that once I settle this matter,
I'll give her right back.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:28.760
Don't screw with me!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.180
Get out of her body right now!

00:14:32.260 --> 00:14:35.060
As feisty as ever, Tsuruume?

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:39.140
If the Princess were not in that condition, I wouldn't have been able to get in.

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:40.350
Hurry up now.

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:43.400
At this rate, she'll be mauled to death.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:46.240
Wasn't she saying the most
inconsiderate things?

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:48.900
She said I performed some
trick on the boy's eye?

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:49.610
How rude.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.950
He's different from all of you.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:54.620
There's no way I would do
such a thing on a whim.

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:57.290
If she has degenerated into such an imbecilic mannequin that she can't even see that,

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.830
then perhaps she <i>is</i> better off
being mauled to death.

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:01.130
Stop!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:03.040
S-Stop it!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.420
Shinshu-chan!

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.710
I have no desire to kill you.

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:07.800
Get out of my way!

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:08.760
I won't!

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:10.050
Move!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.600
You too?

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:17.680
I-I don't think you ought to pick on the weak.

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:19.600
Stop fighting.

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:23.560
Oh, how boring.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:27.070
There I was hoping that she would put
the Princess out of her misery,

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:29.110
and instead this?

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:34.120
I suppose she turned out to be a useless mongrel after all.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.280
Ah well, in that case,

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:38.620
I'm sure you know your bloodline
is going to die out.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:40.620
You bastard!

00:15:45.540 --> 00:15:46.340
Huh?

00:15:46.630 --> 00:15:47.300
You mustn't!

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.550
Somebody!

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:50.550
Rikugou-dono, you must stop her!

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:52.590
You have the power to do so.

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:53.680
Quickly!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:58.390
Stop it!

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:07.400
Too fragile.

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:09.900
Don't be fooled by appearances.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:12.780
That thing wears the shape of a dog,
but it's a monster.

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:14.910
Visualize something that could stop a beast.

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:17.910
Those ridiculously huge jaws, arms, and legs...

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.660
Stop them all.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.960
Huh?! What?! What just happened?!

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:33.800
Th-Thank the gods.

00:16:33.800 --> 00:16:35.470
Were you watching carefully, Shinshu?

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.970
That power belongs only to the "Blank Page."

00:16:47.310 --> 00:16:50.780
Return this dog to its vessel!

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:09.290
What is that woman letting
live inside her body?

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:12.300
Tsuruume-sama, we will treat you immediately.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:14.170
Thanks.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:17.390
Kuchiha!

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:21.350
Are you okay, Kuchiha?

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.810
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.190
You don't need to move.

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.190
I'll get you to a bed—

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:33.690
Get away from her.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.740
She's extremely dangerous.

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:37.200
Hand her over now.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:40.160
That demon could run amok at any time.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.200
It's the right thing to do,
for your sake as well.

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:45.210
You attacked her first!

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.420
What do you know about Kuchiha?

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:49.130
He's right.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:51.420
Your paranoia was the cause of all this.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.970
If you have time to accuse people,
then why don't you apologize instead, for once?

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:57.930
You can start with the guy
that saved your life.

00:17:59.800 --> 00:18:01.930
He's right, Tsuruume.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:03.270
Stand down.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:07.890
I apologize for all the fuss and bother.

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:09.690
Once again, I welcome you as our guests,

00:18:09.690 --> 00:18:14.530
no, as our saviors, and invite you to enjoy the full extent of our hospitality.

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:18.490
Tsuruume, take this lady to a bed,

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.200
and then prepare dinner.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:21.070
Right away.

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.120
That's what you're useful for.

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:28.170
...for the so-called demons that you self-righteously slaughtered.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.670
...you who have persecuted this girl.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:35.260
My role is to defeat demons that perform evil deeds, as the people wish.

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:39.260
What did you make me do?

00:18:39.890 --> 00:18:42.970
That was not my power.

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:45.720
Very well, I will explain it to you in detail...

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.940
but it will be a long discussion.

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:52.730
Please step inside for now.

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:58.860
A meal and tea first, I think.

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:02.240
It seems the Princess has invited us
to enjoy her full hospitality.

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:07.750
By the way, I'm something of a connoisseur, so I want only the finest.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.460
Toki, we might get to eat meat for a change.

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:37.070
It was likely that at least
one of them would perish.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:42.410
Quite amazing.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:43.990
Are you an idiot?

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:46.700
What are you trying to do
by making more enemies?

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:50.410
By its nature, an inugami
should be on our side.

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:53.420
Turning it against us was a most foolish act.

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:55.590
Oh, do shut up.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:58.210
You should show some appreciation for all the trouble I've gone through.

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:00.670
Yeah, yeah, well done with your peeping.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:02.840
You're as creepy as usual.

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:06.510
However, the preparations for the awakening of Hakutaku are progressing well.

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:08.720
Bon, did you do something?

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:09.060
Bon, did you do something?

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:10.980
Nothing particularly remarkable.

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:12.690
How reliable!

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:14.270
All by yourself?

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:18.190
I hate to admit it, but perhaps there was no real need for me to be there.

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:23.160
This makes me even more eager
to bring him here as soon as possible.

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:26.410
You're sure you're not exaggerating
the human's power?

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:28.450
I'm sure of it now.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:32.660
Nothing good ever came of placing your trust in a human.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:36.590
Tsuyukusa, you shouldn't be so harsh.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:40.380
This will make our power greater.

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.170
Well, I'm not going to trust him.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:45.800
Can't you try using your head a little?

00:20:45.800 --> 00:20:48.050
It isn't as if I really trust him.

00:20:49.140 --> 00:20:52.140
There's nothing wrong with making use
of a worthy tool, is there?

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:54.770
And if he outlives his usefulness,
then it's over.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:56.100
I'll get rid of him.

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:57.610
That's all there is to it.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:00.150
You're so despicable.

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:02.440
I'd prefer it if you said "wise."

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:07.450
Well, my work here is done.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:08.830
I'm going to rest.

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:12.160
Bon, don't just curl up in a place like that.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:13.790
What if you catch a cold?

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:17.670
Ah, just be quiet. If you care that much, then come here and be my pillow.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:20.250
Or should I pull out your feathers instead?

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:22.760
My feathers! Don't pull my feathers out! Ow!

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:26.890
All right! All right, I get it! Calm down!

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:27.470
Stop it!

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:28.930
I told you to stop it!

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:30.310
Stop it!
